{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2012886/block/singleImage/3266065/df/01M787QGGYQBPJDHE3ZT49N4A8.jpg?updatedAt=1794499180\"/><p>聖誕檔期向來是商場年度重點推廣時段，聯乘人氣品牌往往極具吸引力。荃新天地於11月20日至2027年1月3日首度聯乘新加坡創意藝術品牌ART-ZOO，推出「Citywalk X ART-ZOO：Joy From The Stars星願聖誕」主題活動，以色彩繽紛的動物角色結合星空元素，打造多個沉浸式打卡場景。活動橫跨荃新天地1期及2期，打卡焦點包括5米高「歡樂毛毛蟲 星際領航員」、首次以太空人造型亮相的Bruno Bear(小熊布魯諾)，及12米高巨型聖誕樹。</p><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2012886/block/singleImage/3266067/df/01M787QGM0GHPDX92RMYPX7NBD.jpg?updatedAt=1794499180\"/><p>此外，2期中庭將化身期間限定星空樂園，多個ART-ZOO人氣角色以巨型充氣裝置登場，讓大小朋友近距離互動拍照。而同步開設的全港首個ART-ZOO期間限定店，將推出AI Photo Booth、Art Jam工作坊及聖誕市集等活動。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T21:44:50.277508+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:40.654347+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T21:37:46.885517+00:00","content_hash":"5016631e3941ed723a81328973d535bb6e8831cc7d74eb80a6f551902639caa8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T21:44:50.277508+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}